# Metadata

Name: stall
Category: computer_architecture/pipeline
Tags: [pipeline, stall, load-use-hazard, hazard-detection-unit]
Dependencies: [pipeline_overview, pipeline_hazard]
Related Skills: [forwarding, bubble]
